**操作建议（不依赖 UI）:**
{{ if or (eq .Labels.alertname "KubeWorkerNodeNotReady") (eq .Labels.alertname "KubeMasterNodeNotReady") (eq .Labels.alertname "MultipleWorkerNodesNotReady") }}
1. `kubectl describe node {{ .Labels.node }}`
2. `kubectl get pods -A --field-selector spec.nodeName={{ .Labels.node }}`
3. 排障见 Runbook §节点 NotReady
{{ else if eq .Labels.alertname "KubePodCrashLooping" }}
1. `kubectl describe pod {{ .Labels.pod }} -n {{ .Labels.namespace }}`
2. `kubectl logs {{ .Labels.pod }} -n {{ .Labels.namespace }} --previous`
3. `kubectl get events -n {{ .Labels.namespace }} --sort-by=.lastTimestamp | tail -20`
{{ else if eq .Labels.alertname "KubeContainerOOMKilled" }}
1. `kubectl describe pod {{ .Labels.pod }} -n {{ .Labels.namespace }}`
2. `kubectl get events -n {{ .Labels.namespace }} --field-selector reason=OOMKilling`
3. 检查容器 memory limit（Runbook §OOM）
{{ else }}
1. `kubectl get events -A --sort-by=.lastTimestamp | tail -30`
2. 见 Runbook 排障步骤
{{ end }}
{{ end }}

